### GeoMeasure API - click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client extension)
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Upload a KML
# @name upload
POST {{base}}/api/files/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="bengaluru_site_survey.kml"
Content-Type: application/vnd.google-earth.kml+xml

< ./samples/bengaluru_site_survey.kml
--b--

### File information
GET {{base}}/api/files/{{upload.response.body.id}}/

### Measurements (projected, default)
GET {{base}}/api/files/{{upload.response.body.id}}/measurements/

### Measurements (geodesic as primary), polygons only
GET {{base}}/api/files/{{upload.response.body.id}}/measurements/?method=geodesic&geometry_type=Polygon

### Features with geometry, CRS and attributes
GET {{base}}/api/files/{{upload.response.body.id}}/features/?limit=5

### GeoJSON export (open in QGIS / geojson.io)
GET {{base}}/api/files/{{upload.response.body.id}}/geojson/

### Upload a zipped shapefile in UTM 43N
POST {{base}}/api/files/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="quarry_site_utm43n.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./samples/quarry_site_utm43n.zip
--b--
